    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Columbia University" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I was 21 years old, a graduate student in chemistry at Columbia University</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Nightfall" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the fifth story, "Nightfall," was about to appear in the September 1941 issue of the magazine</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">FOUNDATION ISAAC ASIMOV</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="The Foundation" id="1">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">On August 11, 1941, therefore, I began the story of that interregnum and called it "Foundation."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Campbell" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">I was bubbling over by the time I got to Campbell's, and my enthusiasm must have been catching for Campbell blazed up as I had never seen him do.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Fred Pohl" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">I had not had a conversation with Fred Pohl on November 2 (on the Brooklyn Bridge, as it happened).</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Boston University School of Medicine" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">By then, I was on the biochemistry faculty of Boston University School of Medicine</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Doubleday" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Doubleday (which had already published a science-fiction novel by me, and which had contracted for another)</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Foundation Trilogy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I picked up my own copy of The Foundation Trilogy and began reading.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="The Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">before beginning a new Foundation novel I had to immerse myself in the style and atmosphere of the series.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="United States of America" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he has been an American citizen since the age of eight</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Boston University" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he found himself Professor of Biochemistry</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="robot stories" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he had begun writing his robot stories</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">shortly after that he had begun his Foundation series</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="Janet Jeppson" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">He is married to Janet Jeppson</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Isaac Asimov" target="New York City" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">and lives in New York City</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Astounding" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Foundation" appeared in the May 1942 issue of Astounding</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Isaac Asimov" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I had spent eight years on the Foundation, written nine stories</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Foundation established on Terminus.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Encyclopedia" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the first and only aim of the Foundation is no longer to publish the definitive Encyclopedia of all human knowledge</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Terminus City Journal" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Terminus City Journal? It isn't mine; it's privately owned. What's it been doing? For weeks now it has been recommending that the fiftieth anniversary of the establishment of the Foundation be made the occasion for public holidays and quite inappropriate celebrations.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="State-supported scientific institution" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Just this: A State-supported scientific institution and part of the personal domain of his august majesty, the Emperor."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="personal domain of his august majesty, the Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Just this: A State-supported scientific institution and part of the personal domain of his august majesty, the Emperor."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">The Emperor is thousands of parsecs away, and I doubt whether he gives a damn about us.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="fraud" id="0">
      <data key="d12">IS_A</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Encyclopedia Foundation, to begin with, is a fraud, and always has been!</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Galaxy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Terminus and its companion Foundation at the other end of the Galaxy</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Renascence" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the seeds of the Renascence and the future founders of the Second Galactic Empire</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="planets of the kingdoms" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">The best men on the planets of the kingdoms are sent here to the Foundation each year and educated into the priesthood.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">he came to me on the day I left Anacreon and requested that the Foundation put this battle cruiser into fighting order and turn it over to the Anacreonian navy.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Anacreon" id="1">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">Tell me, Bort, have you heard anything about a battle cruiser that the Foundation is supposed to have put into shape for use in the Anacreon navy?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="ship" id="0">
      <data key="d12">REPAIR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The one the Foundation is repairing for the navy.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="religion" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">It's this religion the Foundation has established.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="religion" id="1">
      <data key="d12">FOSTERED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The religion – which the Foundation has fostered and encouraged, mind you – is built on on strictly authoritarian lines.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="battle cruiser" id="0">
      <data key="d12">SUPPOSED_TO_HAVE</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">the Foundation is supposed to have put into shape for use in the Anacreon navy</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Anacreonian press" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Anacreonian press never mentions the Foundation at all</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="ORGANIZATION" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d13">1.0</data>
      <data key="d14">Foundation's politics</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="beginning" id="0">
      <data key="d12">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">fiftieth anniversary of the beginning of the Foundation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="scientific development" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FOSTERS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the increasing scientific development fostered by the Foundation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Imperial cruiser" id="0">
      <data key="d12">REPAIRED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">We repaired the Imperial cruiser for you</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="news" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">when the news comes back that the Foundation has been taken</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="hyperwave relay" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the wise men of the Foundation had installed a device so holy it had never been placed in any previous ship, but had been reserved only for this magnificent colossus of a vessel – a hyperwave relay.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="barbarian kingdoms" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">you have now reached domination of the barbarian kingdoms immediately surrounding the Foundation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="first crisis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Just as in the first crisis you held them off by use of the Balance of Power</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="second crisis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">so in the second, you gained mastery by use of the Spiritual Power as against the Temporal</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Second Galactic Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">the Foundation is only at the start of the path that leads to the Second Galactic Empire</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Star's End" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">a Foundation at the other end of the Galaxy, at Star's End.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Guild" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">contrary to the strictest regulations of our Guild.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Askonians" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I have heard that the Foundation is rich.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Periphery" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"The only way we can increase the security of the Foundation here in the Periphery is to form a religion-controlled commercial empire."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Four Kingdoms" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"It's all we can do to hold the Four Kingdoms."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="transmutation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">the Foundation would use transmutation instead of chasing all over the Galaxy for heavy metals.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Galactic Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">we're to rebuild the Galactic Empire</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Seldon Crisis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Each crisis, each Seldon crisis, marks an epoch in our history. We're approaching one now – our third.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Twer" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">He's of the Foundation and, after all, he – is a priest.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Foundation" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
