    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="trial" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">The heavy guns were trained on Dr. Seldon himself.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="project" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Q. Let us see, Dr. Seldon. How many men are now engaged in the project of which you are head?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="project" id="1">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">You have gathered one hundred thousand people within the confines of your project.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="organization" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A. Dr. Dornick has not yet formally joined my organization.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="decline and fall of the Galactic Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Hari Seldon remained unmoved. He waited for the babble to evaporate. A. To minimize the effects of that destruction.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I am aware both of the present status and the past history of the Empire.</data>
    </edge>
