      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">thirty years ago, the Time Vault opened, and on the fiftieth anniversary of the beginning of the Foundation, there appeared a Hari Seldon recording</data>
    </edge>
