      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">We have the science of the great Hari Seldon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon" target="Seldon Crisis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">This is a Seldon crisis we're facing, Sutt, and Seldon crises are not solved by individuals but by historic forces. Hari Seldon, when he planned our course of future history, did not count on brilliant heroics but on the broad sweeps of economics and sociology.</data>
    </edge>
