    <edge source="Hardin" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin had dozed through the initial formalities and then perked up</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="EVENT" id="1">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">In Wienis' chambers, Hardin relaxed in perfect comfort and accepted with a murmur of gratitude the glass of liquor that had been poured out by the regent's own hand.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin felt annoyed.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="The Foundation" id="1">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Interest flickered in Hardin's eyes. He sat up. "Yes, I've heard of that. The Board of Navigation has sent me a petition asking me to obtain the ship for purposes of study.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="The Foundation" id="2">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">It is fifty years now since this Foundation was established – fifty years in which the members of the Foundation have been ignorant of what it was they were working toward.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="The Foundation" id="3">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">with Hardin's help – in the last three decades</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="The Foundation" id="4">
      <data key="d12">SAVED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">when Hardin saved the Foundation from Anacreon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Board" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin groaned in spirit. The Board seemed to suffer violently from Encyclopedia on the brain, He said icily:</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Board" id="1">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">This was the second meeting of the Board that Hardin had attended</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Alurin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">STUDIED_UNDER</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Didn't you study psychology under Alurin?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="politics" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I went into politics</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Lord Dorwin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">the instant detestation in which he had held the noble chancellor</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Lord Dorwin" id="1">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I'll admit I had thought his Lordship a most consummate donkey when I first met him – but it turned out that he was actually an accomplished diplomat and a most clever man.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="treaty" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin said, "No loophole, is there, Dr. Pirenne?"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="record" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I took the liberty of recording all his statements.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="record" id="1">
      <data key="d12">SENT</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I took that record, had it copied out and sent that to Holk for analysis, also.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="City" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">you were to inflame the City into an act of violence</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="City" id="1">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">it was only our recognition of your services to the City that induced us to offer the easy way out.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="City" id="2">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Don't think it was a warning, Mr. Mayor.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Fara" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"But, Hardin," reminded Fara, "we can't!"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Lee" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Sit down, Lee, and give me your moral backing. I'll need it with this young Sermak."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Sef Sermak" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">It was on Sermak that he concentrated</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="foreign policy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Throughout your administration, you have carried out a policy of scientific aid to the Kingdoms.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="mayor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The mayor chuckled.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="epigrams" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">There are many epigrams attributed to Hardin</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Ambassador Verisof" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Superficial, Verisof, superficial. You and I both know that the armament he now has could defeat Terminus handily, long before we could repair the cruiser for our own use.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="opening of the Time Vault" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I was present at the opening of the Time Vault and Seldon's recording revealed it then.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Yohan Lee" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">there are six people now – you and I, the other three ambassadors and Yohan Lee – who have a fair notion of what's ahead</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="crisis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">As soon as all the alternatives disappear, the crisis has come.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="monarch worship" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ESTABLISHED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin established monarch worship</data>
