    <edge source="Hardin" target="Council" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Some of the Party have brought the matter up in Council. Hardin never denied it</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="PERSON" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d13">1.0</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin be impeached</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="City Council" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak raised hell yesterday in the City Council and called for an impeachment.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="coming-of-age of their god-king, Lepold" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">not a person but took feverish part in the hectic religious pageantry that heralded the coming-of-age of their god-king, Lepold</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="war" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">you may consider yourself a prisoner of war</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Wienis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Wienis said thickly, "We can hold out, devil.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="Wienis" id="1">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Wienis struggled vainly for breath, and Hardin continued</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="counterstroke" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I had set my counterstroke for midnight.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="priests" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">"Order them yourself, Wienis, and see who is playing with forces too great for whom."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="hyperwave relay" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Tell me, Wienis, have you ever heard of a hyperwave relay? No, I see you haven't. Well, in about two minutes you'll find out what one can do.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="vote of confidence" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
