    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="torchlight processions" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">torchlight processions had been held in every city street of Terminus</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hardin" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin once said: 'To succeed, planning alone is insufficient. One must improvise as well.'</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board of Trustees" target="personal domain of his august majesty, the Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the Board of Trustees, simply because it is the Board of Trustees acting in the name of the Emperor</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">we're cut off from the inner regions of the Empire. We've been expecting it but that doesn't make it any more comfortable. Anacreon stands square across what was our last remaining trade route</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Empire" id="1">
      <data key="d12">INDEPENDENT_FROM</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the treaty is nothing but a declaration of total independence on the part of Anacreon and a recognition of that status by the Empire</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="personal domain of his august majesty, the Emperor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">SIGNED_TREATY_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">we've just signed a treaty with the Emperor</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="war" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">We've just finished a war with her</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="military base" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">we believe that it would be best for all concerned to have Anacreon establish a military base upon the planet.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="military base" id="1">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Anacreon, then as now, the most powerful of the Four Kingdoms, demanded and later actually established a military base upon Terminus</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="planet" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">There are many of the nobility on Anacreon that would like an addition to their estates.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Periphery" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">And therefore it follows that the rest of the Periphery no longer has nuclear power either. Certainly Smyrno hasn't, or Anacreon wouldn't have won most of the battles in their recent war.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Smyrno" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Certainly Smyrno hasn't, or Anacreon wouldn't have won most of the battles in their recent war.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="imperial navy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">what there was of the imperial navy in these regions is in the hands of the four kingdoms now and Anacreon has its share.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="message" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The message from Anacreon was a simple problem</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="treaty" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">a copy of the treaty between the Empire and Anacreon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the Anacreonian force had landed on Terminus</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="City" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Anacreon was after – outright annexation and imposition of its own feudal system</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">You think Anacreon is all Hari Seldon is likely to be worried about.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Four Kingdoms" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
