    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Temples" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">in the Temples back on Anacreon.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">There is to be war with the Foundation, whether the ship is repaired or not;</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="The Foundation" id="1">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">their government has launched a vicious, unprovoked attack upon the center of their religion.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="LOCATION" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d13">1.0</data>
      <data key="d14">going to Anacreon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="kingdom" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Salvor Hardin did not travel to the planet Anacreon – from which planet the kingdom derived its name</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Galactic Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the inconceivable reaches of the Galactic Empire of which it had once formed so distinguished a part</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Linge Chen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Following closely the boundaries of the old Prefect of Anacreon, it embraced twenty-five stellar systems</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="Space" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">The regent stared. "What in Space are you talking about?"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreon" target="interdict" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the planet Anacreon goes under the interdict.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Terminus City Journal" target="private" id="0">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Terminus City Journal? It isn't mine; it's privately owned.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="King of Anacreon" target="Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">What do you think will happen to the Encyclopedia if this watchmacallum King of Anacreon clamps down on us?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="King of Anacreon" target="Lewis Pirenne" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"His Puissant Majesty, the King of Anacreon, to his friend and brother, Dr. Lewis Pirenne, Chairman of the Board of Trustees, of the Encyclopedia Foundation Number One,"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Anselm haut Rodric – "haut" itself signifying noble blood -Sub-prefect of Pluema and Envoy Extraordinary of his Highness of Anacreon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="Anacreon" id="1">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">his own exploits as battalion head during the recent war between Anacreon and the neighboring newly proclaimed Kingdom of Smyrno</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="Salvor Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Friendship and good will were thus established, and if Hardin noted the barest bulge at Haut Rodric's shoulder, he prudently said nothing.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="sub-prefect" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the sub-prefect</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="Lewis Pirenne" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Pirenne and Haut Rodric – having met with loud and mutual protestations of esteem and regard – were detesting each other's company a good deal more</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="Anacreon-Smyrno War" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">his own exploits as battalion head during the recent war between Anacreon and the neighboring newly proclaimed Kingdom of Smyrno</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="mission of clarification" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Let me understand this, your eminence. Your mission is merely one of clarification?" Haut Rodric nodded through the smoke of his first lusty puffs.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="King of Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"And I am the direct representative of the King of Anacreon.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Haut Rodric bounced it and stared.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="conversation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">When Haut Rodric spoke it was in a voice quite different from what it had been till then</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Haut Rodric" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Anselm haut Rodric had first revealed to him Anacreon's lack of nuclear power</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anselm" target="higher nobility" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">Sub-prefect Anselm received the cheers with the complaisant indifference of a soldier and a nobleman.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Cyclopedia Square" target="city" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">proceeded in a slow, ceremonious manner to Cyclopedia Square, cheered on its way by a properly enthusiastic crowd.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Encyclopedia Building" target="Cyclopedia Square" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">the rest of the slow way to Cyclopedia Square</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Smyrno" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">We've just finished a war with her and she still holds two stellar systems that are ours.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Smyrno" target="Four Kingdoms" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Smyrno, one of the former Four Kingdoms</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Periphery" target="Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">The Empiah is fah bettah off, with the Pewiphewy thwown upon its own wesoahces</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tomaz Sutt" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Tomaz Sutt replied.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tomaz Sutt" target="mayor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Had a talk with the mayor's own secretary." "Snake Sutt?"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="discussion" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Jord Fara bestirred himself for the first time. Up to this point Fara had taken no part in the argument even at its hottest.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Board" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">The Board members did not seem to object to that arrangement. Of them all, only Jord Fara seemed even reasonably calm.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Board of Trustees" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Jord Fara of the old Board of Trustees</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Educated at the Foundation; the Foundation itself, my children.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Anacreonian worlds" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I am Jord Parma, of the Anacreonian worlds.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Galactic Spirit" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I am a Priest of the Spirit educated into all the mysteries, who have come here where the inner voice called me.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Far Star" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Sir, they demand the person of Jord Parma."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Jord Parma's blatant conspicuousness. A missionary on Korell, risking his life in defiance of both Korellian and Foundation law</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Visual Record" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The explanation of this will also explain the incongruities I have pointed out in the Visual Record you have just seen. The two are connected.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="Visual Record" id="1">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">At his left, the Revered Jord Parma, caught in mid-shriek, stretched his claws upward, while the failing sleeves hung halfway.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="trial" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">This whole trial is the biggest farce ever cooked up over an issue that never existed.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jord Parma" target="K S P" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The light had become a set of fuzzy, glowing letters: K S P.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lundin Crast" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Said Lundin Crast, his long nose wrinkling angrily:</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Yate Fulham" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Yate Fulham drew one hand along his ferocious red mustache.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Yate Fulham" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Yate Fulham drew one hand along his ferocious red mustache.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Yate Fulham" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Yate Fulham's mustache twitched.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Lord Dorwin, Chancellor of the Empire, will arrive at Terminus in two weeks.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Empire" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Lord Dorwin, Chancellor of the Empire</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Pirenne" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">He had disappeared with Pirenne half an hour before</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Encyclopedia" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A gweat achievement, this Encyclopedia of yoahs, Hahdin.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I have just come from theah. Most bahbawous planet.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="archaeology" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I, myself, y'know" – he helped himself to a giant pinch of snuff –"dabble in ahchaeology."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="archaeology" id="1">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"His lordship," interrupted Pirenne, "is most thoroughly acquainted with the field."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Jawdun, Obijasi, Kwomwill" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I've gone thwough all of Jawdun, Obijasi, Kwomwill ... oh, all of them, y'know.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Lameth" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Why, I cutainly considah it well wuhth the twip heah to the Pewiphewy to see this copy of Lameth.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Origin Question" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Lameth, you must know," continued the chancellor, pontifically, "pwesents a new and most intwesting addition to my pwevious knowledge of the 'Owigin Question.'</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Lord Dorwin</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Last year we received news here in Terminus about the meltdown of a power plant on Planet V of Gamma Andromeda.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Board" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">This was the second meeting of the Board that Hardin had attended, if one were to exclude the informal talks the Board members had had with the now-departed Lord Dorwin.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Oh, but, Hahdin, that was centuwies ago.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="Lewis Pirenne" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Doctah Piwenne did pwepayah me foah you.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="ultimatum" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">it amounted to an ultimatum, though a superficial reading of the visigraphed document would lead one to suppose that it was a friendly interchange of greetings between two potentates.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="situation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">it's just my opinion that it was your diplomatic transmission of Lord Dorwin's valuable contribution to the situation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="diplomatic transmission" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">your diplomatic transmission of Lord Dorwin's valuable contribution to the situation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="treaty" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">a treaty, incidentally, which is signed on the Emperor's behalf by the same Lord Dorwin</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lord Dorwin" target="scientific research" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Lord Dorwin's idea of scientific research.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Added Sutt:</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="The Foundation" id="1">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The murder of an Anacreonian priest, in the service of the Foundation.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="The Foundation" id="2">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">if he could mobilize the various hierarchies on the subject planets against the Foundation in the name of orthodoxy</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="The Foundation" id="3">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">He tried to control the Foundation itself by religious forces</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"It seems," said Sutt, "that we have no choice but to allow Anacreon to establish military bases on Terminus."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="Manlio" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"I'll tell you, Manlio."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="Manlio" id="1">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">"That much, my friend, is not necessary."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="mayor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The secretary to the mayor entered stiffly</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="Mallow" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">You'd be safer as a destroyed enemy, than as a doubtfully-converted friend.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="Mallow" id="1">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Sutt blinked. Mallow smiled and continued.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="standards of the pious" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">By planting himself at the head of the standards of the pious</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="special election" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">if Sutt forces a special election and has you thrown out?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sutt" target="Hober Mallow" id="0">
      <data key="d12">HATES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Galaxy, he hates me.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Crast" target="Board" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"The Encyclopedia first," ground out Crast.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Crast" target="Lewis Pirenne" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">"I don't know what you're trying to gain by your hysterical statements, Mr. Mayor."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hari Seldon's Vault" target="fiftieth anniversary" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"And on that anniversary," continued Fara, placidly, "Hari Seldon's Vault will open."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Alurin" target="psychologists" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">there are no psychologists on Terminus, and never were, but for Alurin – and he was one of us</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lameth" target="book" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Lameth write his book</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gleen" target="pwevious wuhk" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">based it lahgely on the pwevious wuhk of Gleen</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ahctuwian System" target="thuhd planet" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">thuhd planet of the Ahctuwian System</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="humanity" target="thuhd planet of the Ahctuwian System" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">ahchaeological wemains on the thuhd planet of the Ahctuwian System show that humanity existed theah</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="power plant" target="Planet V of Gamma Andromeda" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Last year we received news here in Terminus about the meltdown of a power plant on Planet V of Gamma Andromeda.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="power plant" target="meltdown" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The powah plant did undergo meltdown and it was quite a catastwophe, y'know.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="government" target="placing seveah westwictions upon the indiscwiminate use of nucleah powah" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CONSIDERS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Weally, the govuhnment is sewiously considewing placing seveah westwictions upon the indiscwiminate use of nucleah powah</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Muller Holk" target="Division of Logic" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Muller Holk of the Division of Logic has his name signed to the analyses</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Holk" target="analysis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">When Holk, after two days of steady work, succeeded in eliminating meaningless statements, vague gibberish, useless qualifications – in short, all the goo and dribble – he found he had nothing left.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mayor Hardin" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I might as well tell you, Mayor Hardin, that the board is not quite blind to your recent activities.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mayor Hardin" target="City" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Come, there's no use looking so furious, Mayor Hardin</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mayor Hardin" target="Dr. Fara" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Fara smiled gently. "You know you don't mean that. Let me speak!"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mayor Hardin" target="Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Mayor Hardin chewed at the end of his cigar.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mayor Hardin" target="City Hall" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Mayor Hardin will see you in half an hour, sir</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mayor Hardin" target="City Hall" id="1">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Mayor Hardin will see you in half an hour, sir</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dr. Fara" target="Vault" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the Board has come to the decision that the real solution to the Anacreonian problem lies in what is to be revealed to us when the Vault opens six days from now.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fara" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">file:///F|/rah/Isaac%20Asimov/Foundation.txt</data>
    </edge>
