    <edge source="Anacreonians" target="landing" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Anacreonians were landing in two days</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreonians" target="landing their first spaceships" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Anacreonians were landing their first spaceships tomorrow</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lee" target="Sef Sermak" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Sermak and his men have been under surveillance for a month now."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lee" target="Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Lee nodded reminiscently, with a half smile. "It was the day we took over the government." "That's right.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="City Council" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak who had already, in his first term in the City Council, turned that sedate body topsy-turvy more than once</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="City Council" id="1">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak who had already, in his first term in the City Council, turned that sedate body topsy-turvy more than once</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Council" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak that he said: "I've been particularly anxious to see you, Councilman, ever since your very excellent speech last month."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Council" id="1">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">a people who are not now truly represented in the rubberstamp body they call the Council.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Council Chamber" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">foreign policy that annoys you so greatly in the Council Chamber.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="people of Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I speak for the people of Terminus</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="new political party" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">we are forming a new political party</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Government" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">And then he opened it with a hard, sudden twist and only Sermak had the sense not to throw a rapid look at the rolled paper that fell out. "In short, gentlemen," he said, "the Government is of the opinion that it knows what it is doing."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="his men" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Sermak and his men have been under surveillance for a month now."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Sermak's new party" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Does that mean you're going to join Sermak's new party?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Next to Sermak himself, Lewis Bort was the most active in rallying those dissident elements which had fused into the now-vociferous Action Party.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Bort" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak said sourly, "If you'd give us the details, Bort–"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin's always said that it was just a fluffy flummery to get them to accept our science without question. You remember, Sermak, he told us that day–</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Hardin" id="1">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak howled that you were a traitor, that you were going to Anacreon to collect your payment</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="PERSON" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d13">1.0</data>
      <data key="d14">Sermak was slamming the table for silence</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sef Sermak" target="Lewis Bort" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
