      <data key="d12">ACCEPTED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Since the Four Kingdoms accepted the Foundation Convention</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Four Kingdoms" target="Galaxy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">the future empire of the Galaxy, and from the course that leads to that Imperium we cannot turn. The religion we have is our all-important instrument towards that end. With it we have brought the Four Kingdoms under our control</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Four Kingdoms" target="religion" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CONTROLLED_BY</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">With it we have brought the Four Kingdoms under our control</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="priests" target="power plants" id="0">
      <data key="d12">IN_CHARGE_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">these priests are in charge of the power plants</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="returning to Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Ambassador Verisof is returning to Terminus.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the ambassador to Anacreon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Mayor Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin looked up at him and grinned. "Have a cigar! How was the trip?" Verisof helped himself.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Wienis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he came to me on the day I left Anacreon and requested that the Foundation put this battle cruiser into fighting order and turn it over to the Anacreonian navy.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">And again Verisof responded with the faintest trace of a smile, "I suppose it's the logical step, Hardin – but I'm worried."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Hardin" id="1">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Hardin had been able to snatch only half an hour from a haggard and harried Verisof before his ambassador was forced to rush off</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Anacreonian navy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">Its cubic capacity is half again that of the entire Anacreonian navy.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Journal" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">But I've been reading the paper." He placed the Journal on the desk and indicated the front page.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="Temples" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">I've heard arguments almost as complicated in the Temples back on Anacreon.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ambassador Verisof" target="priesthood" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">He's high priest to them. As far as I know, he does nothing but act as adviser to the priesthood on technical details.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he was high priest, representative of that Foundation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he was now in the fourteenth year of his double status on Anacreon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="King of Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">to the King of Anacreon – the old one that had been, and the young grandson that was now on the throne – he was simply the ambassador</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="trip to the Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">his first trip to the Foundation in three years</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">he again made use of Hardin's epigram</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="appointment with the mayor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I have an appointment with the mayor this afternoon</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="people of the city" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A priest is at the head. He has been identified as High Priest Poly Verisof.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Poly Verisof" target="surrounding of the palace" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the palace is surrounded by the people of the city. A priest is at the head. He has been identified as High Priest Poly Verisof.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="priest" target="special course in the preparation of radioactive synthetics" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">a priest in the next cabin on his way here to take a special course in the preparation of radioactive synthetics</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="King Lepold" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The key man at Anacreon is the Prince Regent, Wienis. He's King Lepold's uncle.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Terminus" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">I seem to remember Wienis the time I was on Anacreon, when we kicked them off Terminus.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">He's foaming at the mouth with eagerness to attack the Foundation.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="navy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">The old king built up a magnificent navy, and Wienis hasn't been sleeping the last two years.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="royalty" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">Younger sons of royalty get that way, you know.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="battle cruiser" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">once we repair the battle cruiser nothing will stop Wienis from attacking us.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Lepold I" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The fact is that even if you are the regent and my uncle, I'm still king and you're still my subject.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Lepold I" id="1">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">His uncle broke in firmly and continued</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Lepold I" id="2">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I am only regent, and quite human.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Ambassador Verisof" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he believes in that mummery a good deal less than I do, and I don't believe in it at all.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">And then he saw Wienis threading through the crowd toward him and he relaxed.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Hardin" id="1">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Hardin," cried Wienis again, "order your priests back to their jobs."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Foundation series" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">And then he saw Wienis threading through the crowd toward him</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Locris wine" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Locris wine, Hardin," said Wienis, "from the royal cellars.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="king" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the king's father – your elder brother</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Anacreon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">you came to Anacreon alone and accompanied me to my chambers alone.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Anacreon" id="1">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the news of the death of Wienis, and the new treaty signed with the trembling Lepold</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Anacreonian navy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the Anacreonian navy under the lead of my own son upon the flagship, Wienis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Imperial navy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Wienis, once a cruiser of the Imperial navy</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="regent" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">while you were still regent</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Wienis suddenly furious, rushed out of the room.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="palace guards" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Wienis' bull voice sounded. "Get the flares! Get the flares!"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="guardsmen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Wienis cried, "if any of the rabble attempt to pass the palace gates, blast them out of existence."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="army" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">"By Space, Hardin, I will. If it's to be a showdown, so be it. We'll see if your priests can withstand the army."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wienis" target="Salvor Hardin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">he wrested the nuclear blast from the man's hand-aimed it at Hardin</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="King Lepold" target="hunt" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">The king's father died under suspicious circumstances. A needle bullet through the chest during a hunt.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="King Lepold" target="Wienis' chambers" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">while the just-crowned King Lepold sat shriveled in the most shadowy comer, biting spasmodically at his goldbraided sleeve.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Temple property" target="Lucreza" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">They raised one you could hear way out to Lucreza.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreonian merchant ship" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Two weeks ago an Anacreonian merchant ship came across a derelict battle cruiser of the old Imperial Navy.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreonian navy" target="mission" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Anacreonian navy ... aware of the nature of its mission</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreonian navy" target="The Foundation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">those blaspheming sinners ... who would dare to use profane force ... against the Foundation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Anacreonian navy" target="Wienis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
